      },
      "text": "Rootstock  | Tree size       | Precocity  | Support needed | Commercial use\n  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  M.27       | 20% of seedling | Very early | Yes (stake)    | Ultra-dwarf; research\n  M.9        | 25–30%          | Early      | Yes (stake)    | Most commercial orchards\n  M.26       | 35–45%          | Early      | Yes/sometimes  | Home/semi-commercial\n  MM.106     | 50–65%          | Moderate   | Sometimes      | Larger operations\n  MM.111     | 80–90%          | Late       | No             | Dry/poor soils\n  Seedling   | 100% (full)     | Very late  | No             | Cider, traditional orchards"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-GRAFTING.md#022",
