        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Grafting and Budding Techniques",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nT-BUDDING (SHIELD BUDDING):\n  The most widely used grafting method globally.\n  Best for: roses, most stone fruits (peach, plum, cherry), citrus\n  Timing: midsummer when bark \"slips\" (cambium actively growing,\n          bark separates cleanly from wood)"
    },
